      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAPPY AS CAN BE (3) turned in an uncharacteristically poor run most recently when 17 metres away in sixth over 1790m at this track. Form prior to that had been solid. No excuses from this advantageous draw. The recent run not a true indication. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. MY ULTIMATE BILLY NZ (1) settled in a handy position then found the front only to be claimed late in the piece last time out in a nice return to form at this track over 1790m. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Won't find this any harder and he can get up without surprising. KEAYANG MOROCCAN (8) comes right into contention after scoring last start by one metre at this track over 1790m. GOOD BOOTS BINDI (5) is in the mix after turning in a better effort last start to finish second at this track over 1790m.",
